// Windows application icon.
//
// This is what Explorer and the taskbar show for jobcrush.exe itself, even
// when the app is not running. The icon Windows shows for a RUNNING window
// comes from QGuiApplication::setWindowIcon in main.cpp — Windows asks two
// different questions and both have to be answered, or the app looks like a
// blank page in half the places it appears.
IDI_ICON1 ICON "jobcrush-icon.ico"
